      "fieldtype": "Select",
      "options": "Employment\nProcurement\nSupply\nService\nWorks\nConsultancy\nVolunteer\nInternship\nPartnership\nCustomer\nFramework Agreement\nFunding / Grant\nLease\nMemorandum of Understanding\nOther",
